<title>USA: NFO Research Q3 shr $0.23 vs $0.18.</title>
<headline>NFO Research Q3 shr $0.23 vs $0.18.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Ct. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>NFO RESEARCH, INC.</p>
<p>				    Financial Summary</p>
<p>		     (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				  Three Months	   Nine Months</p>
<p>			    Ended September 30   Ended September 30</p>
<p>				  1996	1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenues		  $26,838   $18,564   $76,588    $52,135</p>
<p> Cost of Revenues	 11,550     8,364    33,409     22,754</p>
<p>Selling, General and  </p>
<p>Administrative Expenses</p>
<p>				 9,536     6,166    27,388     18,388</p>
<p>Depreciation and</p>
<p>  Amortization	     1,195	 847     3,529	2,529</p>
<p> Operating Income	  4,557     3,187    12,262	8,464</p>
<p> Interest Expense, Net	11	  24	 114	   45</p>
<p>Equity Interest in Net Loss of</p>
<p>   Joint Ventures	     75	  --	 345	   --</p>
<p>Income Before Income</p>
<p>  Taxes			4,471     3,163    11,803	8,419</p>
