<p>				10,759     9,740    10,677	9,658</p>
<p>NOTE: For comparability, the earnings per share and share data reflect the three-for-two stock split effected February 5, 1996.</p>
<p>The acquisitions of Migliara/Kaplan Associates, Chesapeake Surveys and Plog Research in January 1996 as well as The Spectrem Group in August 1996 contributed $7.6 million to the increase in revenues over the year ago quarter.  Operating income for the quarter increased 43 percent to $4.6 million from $3.2 million for the same period last year reflecting the contributions of the newly acquired companies as well as the company's other businesses.</p>
